<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Axiom started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Axiom started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan said it initiated coverage Axiom Inc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- Said expects Axiom will achieve compound annual revenue and earnings growth of 26 percent and 78 percent, respectively, over the next three years.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month price target of $18 a share.</p>
<p>-- Axiom lost 1/4 to 13-1/4.</p>
